    "_P5_title": "SETUP.TraitDefs Content Character — What Trait Definition Content IS",
    "_P5_brief": "Format-independent definition of trait definition content character. Trait definitions declare behavioral contracts — what types CAN do without specifying HOW. Syntax varies (trait, interface, abstract class); the contract-without-implementation pattern doesn't.",

    // ===================================================================
